#
# Milestone M4 of the OCaml reference engine: 5 conformance case(s).
#
# Vertical composition: rotation and orientation.
#
# One case identifier per line, in the order `jlreq-conformance list` prints
# them. A `#` line and a blank line are comments. The nine files partition the
# eighty-nine built-in cases: every case is in exactly one of them, so the
# cumulative suite M1..Mn grows monotonically and M1..M9 is the whole suite.
#
# M4 is complete when the cumulative suite through M4 runs green:
#
#   cat engines/ocaml/milestones/M{1..4}.ids | ...select from suite.ndjson...
#   cargo run -p jlreq-conformance -- run ENGINE PARTIAL.ndjson   # exit 0

3.2.3/vertical-full-em-western-upright
3.2.3/vertical-proportional-western-rotated
3.1.3/vertical-digit-group-comma-withdraws-half-em
3.1.3/vertical-decimal-middle-dot-withdraws-quarter-ems
3.2.4/vertical-fixed-western-is-quasi-japanese
